B.ce2=new A.aN("Which electricity option should I choose?","Choose Included when electricity is part of rent, Owner bills tenant when you will enter a meter reading, or Borne directly by tenant when the tenant pays the provider. Owner-billed electricity can appear as Combined electricity or Air-con electricity only.")
